diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index aeb1852..795dda5 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,2 +1,20 @@
 Spring 4.1 compliant app that demonstrates the authentication and authorization of a user via JWT
 
+## Modules
+
+Modules are managed by the [module service](https://github.com/yagan93/module_service). This
+service reaches it at `MODULE_SERVICE_URL` (required) with a connect and read timeout, retries and
+a circuit breaker; the optional knobs are `MODULE_SERVICE_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MILLIS` (2000),
+`MODULE_SERVICE_READ_TIMEOUT_MILLIS` (3000), `MODULE_SERVICE_RETRY_MAX_ATTEMPTS` (3),
+`MODULE_SERVICE_RETRY_WAIT_MILLIS` (200) and
+`MODULE_SERVICE_CIRCUIT_BREAKER_WAIT_IN_OPEN_STATE_MILLIS` (10000).
+
+| Method   | Path                              | Authorization            | Status                          |
+|----------|-----------------------------------|--------------------------|---------------------------------|
+| `GET`    | `/modules`                        | authenticated            | `200`                           |
+| `POST`   | `/modules`                        | `USER_MODIFY`            | `201`, `409` duplicate code     |
+| `POST`   | `/users/{id}/modules/{moduleId}`  | own id or `USER_MODIFY`  | `200`, `404` unknown user/module |
+| `DELETE` | `/users/{id}/modules/{moduleId}`  | own id or `USER_MODIFY`  | `200`, `404` unknown user       |
+
+A module is assigned only after the module service confirmed it exists. When the module service
+does not answer or the circuit breaker is open, these endpoints respond `503`.
